A simple plugin that enables dark mode in your admin area.

== Description ==

Cut The Lights is an eye-friendly solution to enhanche you wordpress backoffice experience.
The usage is very simple, just activate Cut The Lights from your plugins menu and watch your backoffice's 
lights turn off in a pleasant dark pitched theme!

### Main Features
* Dark admin panel;
* Lightweight;
* Three themes to choose;
* Night/Light mode toggler;
* More features coming soon!

== Installation ==

1. Upload the cut-the-lights folder to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
1. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress

